# Recipe 13.5 - Prompt-cache key tuning
# Goal: inspect cache telemetry, pin a shared cache key for a RAG batch,
# and restore the automatic session binding afterwards.
# Run: /script doc/cookbook/13_5_cache_key_tuning.chatdsl

/cachekey status
/cachekey set kb-rag-v1
/model mistral_1
Summarize the key ideas of KV-cache reuse in transformer inference.
/cachekey status
/cachekey session
/model mistral_1
Now contrast KV-cache reuse with prefix caching.
